  "title": "Kirby Corporation Announces Date for 2025 Third Quarter Earnings Release and Earnings Webcast",
  "summary": "PDF Version HOUSTON, Sept. 30, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Kirby Corporation (“Kirby”) (NYSE: KEX) will announce its 2025 third quarter results at 6:00 a.m. Central Daylight Time (“CDT”) on Wednesday, October 29, 2025. This announcement will be followed by an earnings conference call webcast at 7:30 a.m. CDT. For listeners who wish to participate in […]",
